{
  "_comment": [
    "Copy to app/google-services.json (untracked) to enable push notifications.",
    "Download it from the Firebase console for an Android app whose package",
    "name is com.nodeloc.app.",
    "",
    "Without this file the Google Services plugin is not applied and the app",
    "builds and runs normally — it simply never obtains a push token, and the",
    "notification poll that already exists is what delivers instead."
  ]
}
